<p>Eventually, we had to leave of course, to meet my son John, his 
girlfriend, Rachel, and my husband Michael at Fuddruckers to enjoy a 
Father's Day dinner. But we <i>will</i> be back!</p>

<img src="IMG_0298.JPG" alt="Fossil Creek Bridge">

